#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: mask"
msgstr ""

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "`.instui-mask` — Et in-flow-overlegg som fyller sin posisjonerte forelder og sentrerer innholdet — f.eks. en spinner over et kort. For en modal, foretrekk en native `<dialog>` (dens `::backdrop` er masken). Hver av disse modifikatorene er også tilgjengelig globalt (alene, eller lenket til en annen komponent) — se den globale hjelpefunksjonen `mask`."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur what's behind the mask with a backdrop-filter."
msgstr "Slør det som er bak masken med backdrop-filter."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed to the viewport, covering it at a high z-index."
msgstr "Festet til viewporten, dekker den med høy z-index."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: maskglobal"
msgstr ""

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "`.--mask-overlay` — En global, dobbel kopi av `mask`-komponentens overlay‑modifikatorer — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — kan brukes alene eller kjedes på hvilken som helst komponent, uten å pakke inn i et `.instui-mask`‑element."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The full mask overlay (position, centring, background)."
msgstr "Hele maskeoverlegget (posisjon, sentrering, bakgrunn)."

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.group"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.group"

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.group` — A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "`.group` — En merket gruppeoverskrift (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "`.item` — Et menyinnslag (InstUI `Menu.Item`); legg til -disabled, -highlighted, eller -active/[aria-checked]."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a checked item with `aria-checked=\"true\"` (same styling as `-active`)."
msgstr "Merk et avkrysset element med `aria-checked=\"true\"` (samme stil som `-active`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Active/checked highlight; same styling as `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "Aktiv/avkrysset markering; samme stil som `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Muted, non-interactive."
msgstr "Dempet, ikke-interaktiv."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlighted background/text (keyboard focus or hover)."
msgstr "Uthevet bakgrunn/tekst (tastaturfokus eller hover)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary info text within the item."
msgstr "Sekundær informasjonstekst i elementet."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu"
msgstr "# CSS: menu"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-menu` — A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "`.instui-menu` — En rullegardinflate med elementer, grupper og skillelinjer."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compose entries as `.item` (see the `menu.item` member), label a section with `.group` (see `menu.group`), and divide sections with `.separator` (see `menu.separator`)."
msgstr "Sett opp oppføringer som `.item` (se medlemmet `menu.item`), merk en seksjon med `.group` (se `menu.group`), og del inn seksjoner med `.separator` (se `menu.separator`)."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tree-browser](/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."
msgstr "- [tree-browser](/nb/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/nb/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.separator"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.separator"

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.separator` — A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "`.separator` — En skillelinje mellom elementer (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: metric"
msgstr ""

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-metric` — A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "`.instui-metric` — En merket statistikk — en stor verdi over en bildetekst."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the value and label, and its own horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values."
msgstr "Setter sin egen `gap` mellom verdi og etikett, og sin egen horisontale `padding`; sammenkjedning av en `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility-modifikator overstyrer disse innebygde verdiene."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Centre the value and label."
msgstr "Sentrer verdi og etikett."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the value and label."
msgstr "Høyrestill verdi og etikett."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the value and label."
msgstr "Venstrestill verdi og etikett."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The caption beneath the value."
msgstr "Bildeteksten under verdien."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The large metric number."
msgstr "Det store metriktallet."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.body"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.body"

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `&lt;img&gt;` goes full-bleed."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Den overordnede `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact` og `-color-inverse`-modifikatorene endrer stilen til dette medlemmet — se `modal`'s egen dokumentasjon for disse modifikatorene."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.footer"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.footer"

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.footer` — The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "`.footer` — Handlingsraden (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Forelderen `modal`'s `-density-compact` og `-color-inverse` modifikatorer endrer stilen til dette medlemmet — se `modal`'s egen dokumentasjon for disse modifikatorene."

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.header"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.header"

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.header` — The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "`.header` — Tittelraden (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal"
msgstr ""

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-modal` — A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "`.instui-modal` — En dialogoverflate (fungerer på et native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer-deler."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `modal.header`, `modal.body`, and `modal.footer` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Se `modal.header`, `modal.body`, og `modal.footer`-medlemmene for de individuelle delene."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Open the native `<dialog>` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."
msgstr "Åpne det native `<dialog>` med `showModal()` for modal semantikk og Esc-for-å-lukke, og navngi det med `aria-labelledby` som peker på `.header`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur the backdrop behind the modal."
msgstr "Slør bakgrunnen bak modalvinduet."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark chrome (pairs with a media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolours each part for the on-dark look."
msgstr "På mørk chrome (parres med et media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Endrer farge på hver del for det mørke utseendet."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter part padding. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Tightens each part's padding."
msgstr "Tettere del-polstring. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Reduserer polstringen på hver del."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Constrain to the viewport and scroll the body. @affects modal.body — Scrolls the body when the modal is capped to the viewport."
msgstr "Begrens til viewport og scroll kroppen. @affects modal.body — Ruller kroppen når modalvinduet er begrenset til viewport."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sized to content."
msgstr "Størrelse til innhold."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Edge-to-edge."
msgstr "Kant-til-kant."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "En bred modal. Langform-alias for `-size-lg`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal."
msgstr "En bred modal."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal."
msgstr "En smal modal."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "En smal modal. Langform-alias for `-size-sm`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dims the page behind the dialog as its mask, and frosts it under `-blur`."
msgstr "Demper siden bak dialogen som en maske, og frostet den under `-blur`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Styles a native &lt;dialog&gt; and its `::backdrop`; the top-layer rendering and backdrop styling need a browser that supports the dialog element."
msgstr "- Stiler et native &lt;dialog&gt; og dets `::backdrop`; topplag-rendering og bakgrunnsstil krever en nettleser som støtter dialog-elementet."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — En tray er det samme avvikbare overløpsmønsteret, forankret til en skjermkant."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: number-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-number-input` — A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "`.instui-number-input` — En tall-inndata-fasade med en +/- spinner-kolonne."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.arrows` buttons are `aria-hidden` and purely presentational — incrementing/decrementing the value on click is the consumer's JS to wire up."
msgstr "Knappene på `.arrows` er `aria-hidden` og kun presentasjonsmessige — å øke/redusere verdien ved klikk må konsumentens JS kobles til."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Put the accessible name on the `<input>` (e.g. `aria-label`) so the field owns the value; the +/- spinner buttons are decorative and marked `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Sett det tilgjengelige navnet på `<input>` (f.eks. `aria-label`) slik at feltet eier verdien; +/- spinner-knappene er dekorative og merket `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium."
msgstr "(standard) Middels."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "(standard) Middels. Langform-alias for `-size-md`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The +/- spinner column at the inline-end."
msgstr "Den +/- spinner-kolonnen ved inline-enden."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The decrement button; the unclassed button increments."
msgstr "Knappen for å redusere; den uklassifiserte knappen øker verdien."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The masked chevron glyph on each spinner button: up to increment, down on `.down`."
msgstr "Det maskerte chevron-ikonet på hver spinner-knapp: opp for å øke, ned for å redusere på `.down`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same input facade chrome.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — Another numeric input control."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Deler samme input-fasade-utseende.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — En annen numerisk inndatakontroll."

