#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-details"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-details` — A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-details` — En stilisert innfødt `<details>`-disclosure med en roterende chevron."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the native `<details>` element, so the browser drives open and close plus keyboard support; the CSS only hides the default marker and supplies the rotating chevron."
msgstr "Bygget på det innfødte `<details>`-elementet, så nettleseren håndterer åpning og lukking pluss tastaturstøtte; CSS-en skjuler bare standardmarkøren og leverer den roterende chevronen."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the chevron after the summary."
msgstr "Plasser chevronen etter summary."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filled (surface) variant."
msgstr "Fylt (surface)-variant."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the disclosure is open."
msgstr "Tegner summary's disclosure-chevron, et maskert glyf som roterer for å peke ned når disclosureen er åpen."

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — The bordered, grouped form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — Den innrammede, grupperte formen av samme disclosure."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-group` — A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-group` — En innrammet disclosure bygget på `<details>`: en sammendragsrad med chevron og sammenleggbart innhold."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the same native `<details>` foundation as toggle-details; put the `<summary>` first so it becomes the clickable header row and the rest is the collapsible content."
msgstr "Bygget på samme native `<details>`-grunnlag som toggle-details; plasser `<summary>` først slik at det blir den klikkbare overskriftsraden og resten blir det sammenleggbare innholdet."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary row's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the group is open."
msgstr "Tegner sammendragsradens disclosure-chevron, en maskert glyf som roterer for å peke ned når gruppen er åpen."

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — The single, unbordered form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — Den enkle, uinnrammede formen av samme disclosure."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tooltip"
msgstr ""

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tooltip` — A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "`.instui-tooltip` — En CSS hover- og fokus-verktøytipsboble, plasserbar på hvilken som helst side."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Toggling is pure CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), so the bubble only reaches keyboard users through a focusable trigger; unlike `popover`, it isn't dismissible or click-triggered."
msgstr "Veksling er ren CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), så boblen er kun tilgjengelig for tastatursbrukere via en fokuserbar trigger; i motsetning til `popover` er den ikke avvisbar eller klikk-utløst."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Point the trigger at the bubble with aria-describedby and give the bubble role=\"tooltip\"."
msgstr "Pek triggeren mot boblen med aria-describedby og gi boblen role=\"tooltip\"."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a trigger glyph icon next to the tooltip bubble."
msgstr "Vis et trigger-glyf-ikon ved siden av verktøytipsboblen."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The bubble; `-placement-*` sets its side."
msgstr "Boblen; `-placement-*` angir hvilken side den skal være på."

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The larger, click-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Den større, klikk-utløste forankrede flaten.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — En beslektet forankret flate med en peker."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: transition"
msgstr ""

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — animasjonsstatusklasser for `Transition`-komponenten — `.instui-transition` og statusklasser (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, osv.) — kan brukes alene eller kjedes på hvilken som helst komponent."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Transition type/state class toggled by runtime (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."
msgstr "Overgangstype/statusklasse som veksles av kjøretiden (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state."
msgstr "Animasjonsvarighet (standard `300ms`); overskriv for å gjøre hver overgangsstatus raskere eller langsommere."

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`)."
msgstr "Animasjons-timingfunksjon (standard `ease-in-out`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tray` — An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "`.instui-tray` — Et panel festet til kanten som skyves inn fra hvilken som helst side; et native `[popover]` eller `<dialog>`."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start/end placements resolve against `inset-inline` (logical, direction-aware); the slide-in transform mirrors automatically under an ancestor `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, so no extra markup is needed for right-to-left layouts."
msgstr "Start-/sluttplasseringer løses i forhold til `inset-inline` (logisk, retningsbevisst); slide-in-transformasjonen speiles automatisk under en forelder `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, så ingen ekstra markup er nødvendig for høyre-til-venstre-oppsett."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The tray is a dialog or popover surface, so name it with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`, and its close control carries an `aria-label` (the `.instui-close-button` in the example uses `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "Trayen er et dialog- eller popover-område, så navngi den med `aria-label` eller `aria-labelledby`, og lukkekontrollen har et `aria-label` (eksempelets `.instui-close-button` bruker `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the bottom edge."
msgstr "Fest til nederste kant."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the end (inline-end) edge."
msgstr "Fest til endekanten (inline-end)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Pin to the start (inline-start) edge."
msgstr "(standard) Fest til startkanten (inline-start)."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the top edge."
msgstr "Fest til øverste kant."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-size-md`."
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Opens with the native `[popover]` API and `@starting-style`; the slide-in sits behind an `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` guard, so browsers without it still open the tray, just without the slide."
msgstr "- Åpnes med native `[popover]`-APIet og `@starting-style`; slide-in ligger bak en `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)`-beskyttelse, så nettlesere uten denne åpner fortsatt trayen, bare uten slide."

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — The same dismissible overlay pattern, centred instead of edge-pinned.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer surface this builds on."
msgstr "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — Samme avvisbare overlay-mønster, sentrert i stedet for festet til kanten.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — Den generiske topplagsflaten dette bygger på."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tree-browser"
msgstr ""

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tree-browser` — A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "`.instui-tree-browser` — Et avsløringstre av nestede samlinger og bladposter, med roterende chevrons."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each collection is a native `<details>`; nesting them inside one another builds the tree, and the browser handles opening and closing every branch."
msgstr "Hver samling er en native `<details>`; å nest dem i hverandre bygger treet, og nettleseren håndterer åpning og lukking av hver gren."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the root with role=\"tree\" and each nested list with role=\"group\"."
msgstr "Marker roten med role=\"tree\" og hver nestede liste med role=\"group\"."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render folder/file glyph icons in summaries and leaf items."
msgstr "Vis mappe-/filglyf-ikoner i sammendrag og bladelementer."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A leaf entry in the tree."
msgstr "Et bladelement i treet."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws each collection's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the branch is open."
msgstr "Tegner hver samlings avslørings-chevron, en maskert glyf som roterer for å peke ned når grenen er åpen."

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries."
msgstr "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Viser begge nestede, valgbare oppføringer."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: truncate"
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis-avkorting med linjeklamring styrt av `--lines` — kan brukes alene eller kjedes på hvilken som helst komponent (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base class uses `display: -webkit-box` and reads the `--lines` custom property to clamp text to a fixed number of lines before it ends in an ellipsis."
msgstr "Basis‑klassen bruker `display: -webkit-box` og leser den tilpassede egenskapen `--lines` for å begrense tekst til et fast antall linjer før den avsluttes med ellipsis."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "JS Requirement"
msgstr "JS-krav"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component ships no CSS of its own — its markup and behavior come entirely from `@pantoken/interactions`. Its `--max-lines-auto` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "Denne komponenten leverer ingen egen CSS — markup og oppførsel kommer helt fra `@pantoken/interactions`. Dens `--max-lines-auto`-modifikator drives av den oppførselen. Se [modifikatortabellen nedenfor](#modifiers)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-1`."
msgstr "Alias for `--max-lines-1`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-2`."
msgstr "Alias for `--max-lines-2`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-3`."
msgstr "Alias for `--max-lines-3`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-4`."
msgstr "Alias for `--max-lines-4`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-5`."
msgstr "Alias for `--max-lines-5`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to one line (default)."
msgstr "Begrens til én linje (standard)."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to two lines."
msgstr "Begrens til to linjer."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to three lines."
msgstr "Begrens til tre linjer."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to four lines."
msgstr "Begrens til fire linjer."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to five lines."
msgstr "Begrens til fem linjer."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — — Clamp to the number of lines that fit in the container, based on its height and the line height of the text."
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enables truncation and line clamping on the target element."
msgstr "Aktiverer avkorting og linjeklamring på mål‑elementet."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Truncate at the character level."
msgstr "(standard) Avkort på tegnnivå."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Truncate at the word level."
msgstr "Avkort på ordnivå."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Clamping relies on `-webkit-line-clamp` with `display: -webkit-box`, paired with the standard `line-clamp`."
msgstr "- Klamring avhenger av `-webkit-line-clamp` med `display: -webkit-box`, kombinert med standard `line-clamp`."

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography that this truncates."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Brødtypografi som dette avkorter."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: two-column"
msgstr ""

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — To-kolonners oppsett med venstre og høyre innholdsregioner."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "✅ Bruk Two-Column når:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You have two content areas of roughly equal importance\n- Comparing or contrasting two sets of content side-by-side\n- Building a responsive layout that stacks on mobile\n🚫 Don't use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "- Du har to innholdsområder med omtrent lik betydning\n- Sammenligner eller kontrasterer to sett med innhold side om side\n- Bygger et responsivt oppsett som stabler på mobil\n🚫 Ikke bruk Two-Column når:"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- One column dominates the page — use asymmetric layout instead\n- Content doesn't benefit from side-by-side presentation"
msgstr "- Én kolonne dominerer siden — bruk i stedet et asymmetrisk oppsett\n- Innholdet har ingen fordel av side-til-side presentasjon"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure both columns are perceivable and usable on narrow viewports\n- Use semantic landmarks (e.g., `<section>`) to wrap column content\n- Maintain sufficient space and contrast between columns"
msgstr "- Sørg for at begge kolonnene er synlige og brukbare på smale visningsflater\n- Bruk semantiske landemerker (f.eks. `<section>`) for å omslutte kolonneinnhold\n- Oppretthold tilstrekkelig avstand og kontrast mellom kolonnene"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional visual divider between columns."
msgstr "Valgfri visuell skillelinje mellom kolonnene."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Left column content area."
msgstr "Innholdsområde for venstre kolonne."

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Right column content area."
msgstr "Innholdsområde for høyre kolonne."

#: css/view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: view"
msgstr ""

#: css/view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-view` — The View primitive: a neutral box with key-value modifiers for background, border, radius, shadow, display, position, overflow, and cursor. Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."
msgstr "`.instui-view` — View-primitivet: en nøytral boks med nøkkel-verdi-modifikatorer for bakgrunn, kant, radius, skygge, display, posisjon, overløp og markør. Hver av disse modifikatorene er også tilgjengelige globalt (stående alene, eller lenket til en hvilken som helst annen komponent) — se `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor`-verktøyene."

#: css/view.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
