msgstr "`@pantoken/figma` — konverterer Instructure token-IR til en Figma Variables-payload."

#: design/figma/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It produces one variable collection with `light`/`dark` modes: colour tokens become `COLOR`\nvariables (RGBA 0–1), dimensions/numbers become `FLOAT`, everything else `STRING`. Icons are\nexcluded (they'd be Figma components, not variables). Feed [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) to a Figma\nplugin (the Variables plugin API) or the Variables REST API — the README has the plugin glue."
msgstr "Den produserer én variabelsamling med `light`/`dark`-moduser: farge-tokens blir `COLOR`\nvariabler (RGBA 0–1), dimensjoner/tall blir `FLOAT`, alt annet `STRING`. Ikoner er\nutelatt (de ville vært Figma-komponenter, ikke variabler). Send [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) til en Figma\nplugin (Variables plugin API) eller Variables REST API — README-en har plugin-limet."

#: design/figma/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md)"
msgstr "Omdøper og re-eksporterer [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md)"

