msgstr "Den fokuserbare selektoren som basisringen gjelder for (standard [FOCUSABLE\\_SELECTOR](../variables/FOCUSABLE_SELECTOR.md))."

#: formats/components/src/functions/focusOutlineRules.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
