#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: CommandEventish"
msgstr "# Grensesnitt: CommandEventish"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `command`/`source` shape of an Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (not yet in DOM lib types)."
msgstr "Formen `command`/`source` til en Invoker Commands `CommandEvent` (ikke ennå i DOM-bibliotekstypene)."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### command"
msgstr "### command"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### source"
msgstr "### source"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### bubbles"
msgstr "### bubbles"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`bubbles`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event bubbles up through the DOM tree or not."
msgstr "Den **`bubbles`** skrivebeskyttede egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet angir om hendelsen bobler opp gjennom DOM-treet eller ikke."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~cancelBubble~~"
msgstr "### ~~cancelBubble~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelBubble`** property of the Event interface is deprecated. Use Event.stopPropagation() instead. Setting its value to true before returning from an event handler prevents propagation of the event. In later implementations, setting this to false does nothing. See Browser compatibility for details."
msgstr "Den **`cancelBubble`**-egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet er utdatert. Bruk Event.stopPropagation() i stedet. Å sette verdien til true før retur fra en hendelseshåndterer forhindrer propagasjon av hendelsen. I senere implementasjoner gjør det ingenting å sette denne til false. Se Nettleserkompatibilitet for detaljer."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Deprecated"
msgstr "#### Utdatert"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### cancelable"
msgstr "### cancelable"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`cancelable`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates whether the event can be canceled, and therefore prevented as if the event never happened."
msgstr "Den **`cancelable`** skrivebeskyttede egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet angir om hendelsen kan avbrytes, og dermed hindres som om hendelsen aldri skjedde."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### composed"
msgstr "### composed"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`composed`** property of the Event interface returns a boolean value which indicates whether or not the event will propagate across the shadow DOM boundary into the standard DOM."
msgstr "Den skrivebeskyttede **`composed`**-egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet returnerer en boolsk verdi som angir om hendelsen vil propagere over shadow DOM-grensen inn i standard DOM eller ikke."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### currentTarget"
msgstr "### currentTarget"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`currentTarget`** read-only property of the Event interface identifies the element to which the event handler has been attached."
msgstr "Den **`currentTarget`** skrivebeskyttede egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet identifiserer elementet som hendelseshåndtereren er festet til."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### defaultPrevented"
msgstr "### defaultPrevented"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`defaultPrevented`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a boolean value indicating whether or not the call to Event.preventDefault() canceled the event."
msgstr "Den **`defaultPrevented`** skrivebeskyttede egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet returnerer en boolsk verdi som indikerer om anropet til Event.preventDefault() avbrøt hendelsen."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### eventPhase"
msgstr "### eventPhase"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`eventPhase`** read-only property of the Event interface indicates which phase of the event flow is currently being evaluated."
msgstr "Den **`eventPhase`** skrivebeskyttede egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet angir hvilken fase av hendelsesflyten som for øyeblikket evalueres."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### isTrusted"
msgstr "### isTrusted"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`isTrusted`** read-only property of the Event interface is a boolean value that is true when the event was generated by the user agent (including via user actions and programmatic methods such as HTMLElement.focus()), and false when the event was dispatched via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). The only exception is the click event, which initializes the isTrusted property to false in user agents."
msgstr "Den **`isTrusted`** skrivebeskyttede egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet er en boolsk verdi som er true når hendelsen ble generert av brukeragenten (inkludert via brukerhandlinger og programmatiske metoder som HTMLElement.focus()), og false når hendelsen ble sendt via EventTarget.dispatchEvent(). Det eneste unntaket er click-hendelsen, som initialiserer isTrusted-egenskapen til false i brukeragenter."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~returnValue~~"
msgstr "### ~~returnValue~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The Event property **`returnValue`** indicates whether the default action for this event has been prevented or not."
msgstr "Event-egenskapen **`returnValue`** angir om standardhandlingen for denne hendelsen har blitt forhindret eller ikke."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### ~~srcElement~~"
msgstr "### ~~srcElement~~"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The deprecated **`Event.srcElement`** is an alias for the Event.target property. Use Event.target instead."
msgstr "Den utdaterte **`Event.srcElement`** er et alias for Event.target-egenskapen. Bruk Event.target i stedet."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The read-only **`target`** property of the Event interface is a reference to the object onto which the event was dispatched. It is different from Event.currentTarget when the event handler is called during the bubbling or capturing phase of the event."
msgstr "Den skrivebeskyttede **`target`**-egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet er en referanse til objektet hendelsen ble dispatchet på. Den er forskjellig fra Event.currentTarget når hendelseshåndtereren kalles under bubbling- eller capturing-fasen av hendelsen."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### timeStamp"
msgstr "### timeStamp"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`timeStamp`** read-only property of the Event interface returns the time (in milliseconds) at which the event was created."
msgstr "Den **`timeStamp`** skrivebeskyttede egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet returnerer tidspunktet (i millisekunder) da hendelsen ble opprettet."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The **`type`** read-only property of the Event interface returns a string containing the event's type. It is set when the event is constructed and is the name commonly used to refer to the specific event, such as click, load, or error."
msgstr "Den **`type`** skrivebeskyttede egenskapen på Event-grensesnittet returnerer en streng som inneholder hendelsestypen. Den settes når hendelsen konstrueres og er navnet som vanligvis brukes for å referere til den spesifikke hendelsen, som click, load eller error."

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### NONE"
msgstr "### NONE"

#: formats/interactions/src/interfaces/CommandEventish.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"
msgstr "### CAPTURING\\_PHASE"

