#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "#### Default Value"
msgstr "#### Standardverdi"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### onMissingInitialValue?"
msgstr "### onMissingInitialValue?"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "What to do with an `@property` at-rule that has no `initial-value` descriptor."
msgstr "Hva som skal gjøres med en `@property` at-rule som ikke har `initial-value`-beskrivelse."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"remove\"` — drop the at-rule (default).\n- `\"keep\"` — leave it in the output untouched."
msgstr "- `\"remove\"` — fjern at-regelen (standard).\n- `\"keep\"` — la den være i utdataene uendret."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: flattenProperty"
msgstr "# Variabel: flattenProperty"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the flatten-`@property` PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Opprett flatten-`@property` PostCSS-pluginen."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Walks all `@property` at-rules in the stylesheet, extracts each `initial-value` descriptor, removes\nthe at-rule, and prepends a single `injectSelector { --name: value; … }` rule containing all\nextracted declarations. Empty rules and `@layer` blocks left behind after removal are dropped."
msgstr "Går gjennom alle `@property` at-regler i stilarket, ekstraherer hver `initial-value`-beskrivelse, fjerner\nat-regelen, og setter inn foran en enkelt `injectSelector { --name: value; … }`-regel som inneholder alle\nekstraherte deklarasjoner. Tomme regler og `@layer`-blokker som blir liggende igjen etter fjerningen fjernes."

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Default injection into :root**"
msgstr "**Standard injeksjon i :root**"

#: plugins/postcss/flatten-property/src/variables/flattenProperty.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Inject into :scope (for use inside scope blocks)**"
msgstr "**Injiser i :scope (for bruk inne i scope-blokker)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# mangle-custom-props"
msgstr "# mangle-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — rename long custom property names to minimal sequential\nidentifiers."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-mangle-custom-props` — omdøp lange egendefinerte egenskapsnavn til minimale, sekvensielle identifikatorer."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Token names like `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` are human-readable but expensive in\nminified bundles: the name itself is 40+ bytes, repeated in the definition, every `var()` call,\nand every `@property` registration. This plugin replaces every matching name — across definitions,\n`var()` references, and `@property` params — with a minimal identifier (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), cutting name overhead by ~90%."
msgstr "Token-navn som `--instui-component-alert-border-top-style` er menneskelesbare, men dyre i minifiserte bundler: selve navnet er 40+ byte, gjentatt i definisjonen, i hver `var()`-kall,\nog i hver `@property`-registrering. Denne pluginen erstatter hvert matchende navn — på tvers av definisjoner,\n`var()`-referanser og `@property`-parametre — med en minimal identifikator (`--a`, `--b`, …, `--aa`,\n…), og reduserer navnoverhead med ~90 %."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Names are collected from the full stylesheet, sorted alphabetically for a deterministic mapping,\nthen assigned sequentially. A [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest) option lets multiple\nseparate PostCSS passes share one consistent mapping, so separately processed CSS files that will\nbe loaded together can safely be mangled with the same names."
msgstr "Navn samles inn fra hele stylesheetet, sorteres alfabetisk for en deterministisk mapping,\nog tildeles deretter sekvensielt. En [MangleCustomPropsOptions.sharedManifest](interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md#sharedmanifest)-opsjon lar flere\nseparate PostCSS-passer dele én konsistent mapping, slik at separat prosesserte CSS-filer som skal\nlastes sammen trygt kan manglees med de samme navnene."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: MangleCustomPropsOptions"
msgstr "# Grensesnitt: MangleCustomPropsOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Alternativer for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only custom property names that start with this string are mangled."
msgstr "Bare egendefinerte egenskapsnavn som begynner med denne strengen blir endret."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### method?"
msgstr "### method?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The algorithm used to generate short replacement names."
msgstr "Algoritmen som brukes for å generere korte erstatningsnavn."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (default; shortest for large sets)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alphanumeric)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"
msgstr "- `\"base26\"` — `--a`, `--b`, …, `--z`, `--aa`, `--ab`, … (standard; kortest for store sett)\n- `\"base36\"` — `--0`, `--1`, …, `--9`, `--a`, …, `--z`, `--10`, … (alfanumerisk)\n- `\"numeric\"` — `--0`, `--1`, `--2`, …"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### propertyMap?"
msgstr "### propertyMap?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When `true`, appends a `mangle-map` entry to PostCSS `result.messages` after processing.\nThe message has shape `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."
msgstr "Når `true`, legger til en `mangle-map`-oppføring i PostCSS `result.messages` etter behandling.\nMeldingen har formen `{ type: \"mangle-map\", plugin: \"pantoken-mangle-custom-props\", map: Map<string, string> }`."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### sharedManifest?"
msgstr "### sharedManifest?"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A mutable `Map` shared across multiple PostCSS passes."
msgstr "En muterbar `Map` delt mellom flere PostCSS-passer."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On each pass the plugin reads existing entries (reusing their short names) and writes new\nones (continuing the counter from `sharedManifest.size`). Pass the same `Map` instance to\nevery `mangleCustomProps` or `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files which will be\nloaded together in the browser — this guarantees all files use an identical name mapping."
msgstr "Ved hver passering leser pluginet eksisterende oppføringer (gjenbruker deres korte navn) og skriver nye\n(fortsetter telleren fra `sharedManifest.size`). Send samme `Map`-instans til\nhver `mangleCustomProps` eller `applyMinify`-kall som behandler CSS-filer som vil bli\nlastet sammen i nettleseren — dette garanterer at alle filer bruker en identisk navnemapping."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Process the token sheet first so its names are seeded into the manifest before the component\nsheets add their (typically overlapping) references."
msgstr "Behandle tokenskjemaet først slik at navnene blir lagt inn i manifestet før komponent-\nskjemaene legger til sine (vanligvis overlappende) referanser."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Type Alias: MangleMethod"
msgstr "# Typealias: MangleMethod"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/type-aliases/MangleMethod.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Short-name generation strategy for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."
msgstr "Strategi for å generere korte navn for [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: mangleCustomProps"
msgstr "# Variabel: mangleCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the mangle-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Opprett PostCSS-pluginen mangle-custom-properties."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collects all custom property names matching `prefix` from declaration props, `var()` references,\nand `@property` params. Sorts them alphabetically for a stable, deterministic mapping, then\nassigns short names using the chosen `method`. Replaces every occurrence throughout the stylesheet."
msgstr "Samler alle egendefinerte egenskapsnavn som matcher `prefix` fra deklarasjonsprops, `var()`-referanser,\nog `@property`-parametere. Sorterer dem alfabetisk for en stabil, deterministisk kartlegging, og\ntilordner korte navn ved hjelp av valgte `method`. Erstatter alle forekomster i hele stilarket."

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle with defaults (--instui-\\*, base26)**"
msgstr "**Mangle med standardinnstillinger (--instui-\\\\*, base26)**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Share the mapping across two files loaded together**"
msgstr "**Del kartleggingen mellom to filer som lastes sammen**"

#: plugins/postcss/mangle-custom-props/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Use base36 names and emit the mapping via result.messages**"
msgstr "**Bruk base36-navn og inkluder kartleggingen i result.messages**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: applyMinify()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: applyMinify()"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply custom-property minification transforms to a stylesheet string."
msgstr "Bruk minifiserings-transformasjoner for custom properties på en stylesheet-streng."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Builds a PostCSS plugin array from `options` and runs it synchronously. Plugin order:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returns the input unchanged when\nno options are set."
msgstr "Bygger et PostCSS-plugin-array fra `options` og kjører det synkront. Plugin-rekkefølge:\n`pruneCustomProps` → `flattenProperty` → `mangleCustomProps`. Returnerer input uendret når\ningen alternativer er satt."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The stylesheet string to transform."
msgstr "Stylesheet-strengen som skal transformeres."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/functions/applyMinify.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The transformed CSS string."
msgstr "Den transformerte CSS-strengen."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# props-minify"
msgstr "# props-minify"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — compose prune, flatten, and mangle transforms for\n`--instui-*` custom properties via a single [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) utility."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-props-minify` — komponer prune, flatten og mangle-transformasjoner for\n`--instui-*` egendefinerte egenskaper via et enkelt [applyMinify](functions/applyMinify.md) verktøy."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each CSS-emitting pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) uses `applyMinify` for a consistent\nminification surface without taking a direct PostCSS dependency."
msgstr "Hver CSS-utgivende pipeline (generate scripts, renderers) bruker `applyMinify` for en konsistent\nminifiseringsflate uten å ta en direkte PostCSS-avhengighet."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Prune + mangle are only safe for self-contained bundles** where all `var(--instui-*)` references\nand their definitions live in the same output. For separate-file consumers (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` loaded independently), apply `{ flatten: true }` only."
msgstr "**Prune + mangle er kun trygt for selvstendige bundles** hvor alle `var(--instui-*)` referanser\nog deres definisjoner ligger i samme output. For forbrukere med separate filer (`@pantoken/css` +\n`@pantoken/components` lastet uavhengig), bruk kun `{ flatten: true }`."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle across file boundaries:** pass the same `Map` instance as\n`mangle.sharedManifest` to every `applyMinify` call that processes CSS files loaded together.\nProcess the token sheet first (it seeds the manifest), then component sheets."
msgstr "**Mangle på tvers av filgrenser:** pass den samme `Map`-instansen som\n`mangle.sharedManifest` til hvert `applyMinify`-kall som behandler CSS-filer lastet sammen.\nBehandle token-arket først (det fyller manifestet), deretter komponentarkene."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Apply all three transforms to a self-contained bundle**"
msgstr "**Bruk alle tre transformasjonene på en selvstendig bundle**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Flatten only (safe for separate-file consumers)**"
msgstr "**Kun flatten (trygt for forbrukere med separate filer)**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Mangle two files with the same mapping**"
msgstr "**Mangle to filer med samme kartlegging**"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: PropsMinifyOptions"
msgstr "# Grensesnitt: PropsMinifyOptions"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Options for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."
msgstr "Alternativer for [applyMinify](../functions/applyMinify.md)."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### prune?"
msgstr "### prune?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) to tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens before other transforms."
msgstr "Bruk [pruneCustomProps](../variables/pruneCustomProps.md) for å tree-shake ubrukte `--instui-*`-tokens før andre transformasjoner."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles that contain both token definitions and the component\nrules that reference them. Pruning a token-only sheet removes everything."
msgstr "Trygt bare for selvstendige bundles som inneholder både tokendefinisjoner og komponent\nreglene som refererer til dem. Å beskjære et ark som kun inneholder tokens fjerner alt."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### flatten?"
msgstr "### flatten?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) to convert `@property` at-rules to plain declarations."
msgstr "Bruk [flattenProperty](../variables/flattenProperty.md) for å konvertere `@property` at-regler til vanlige deklarasjoner."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "`true` bruker plugin-standardinnstillinger (`injectSelector: \":root\"`, `onMissingInitialValue: \"remove\"`).\nSend et [FlattenPropertyOptions](FlattenPropertyOptions.md)-objekt for å overstyre individuelle standardverdier."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### mangle?"
msgstr "### mangle?"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) to replace long `--instui-*` names with minimal identifiers."
msgstr "Bruk [mangleCustomProps](../variables/mangleCustomProps.md) for å erstatte lange `--instui-*`-navn med minimale identifikatorer."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`true` uses plugin defaults (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nPass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override individual defaults — including\n`sharedManifest` for cross-file coordination."
msgstr "`true` bruker plugin-standardinnstillinger (`prefix: \"--instui-\"`, `method: \"base26\"`).\nSend et [MangleCustomPropsOptions](MangleCustomPropsOptions.md)-objekt for å overstyre individuelle standardverdier — inkludert\n`sharedManifest` for koordinering på tvers av filer."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/PropsMinifyOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Only safe for self-contained bundles. See module-level docs."
msgstr "Trygt bare for selvstendige bundles. Se modulnivådokumentasjonen."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: pruneCustomProps"
msgstr "# Variabel: pruneCustomProps"

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Create the prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS plugin."
msgstr "Opprett prune-unused-custom-properties PostCSS-pluginen."

#: plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/pruneCustomProps.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Run it as a standalone PostCSS pass**"
msgstr "**Kjør den som et frittstående PostCSS-pass**"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# prune-custom-props"
msgstr "# prune-custom-props"

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — tree-shake unused custom properties from a composed\nstylesheet."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-prune-custom-props` — fjerner ubrukte egendefinerte egenskaper fra et sammensatt\nstilark."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "pantoken's `@pantoken/css` emits the whole `--instui-*` token set (≈1,800 icon data-URIs\nincluded). A renderer that builds on that layer but only styles a slice of the system would\notherwise ship the entire set — so any such renderer wants this. Starting from the `var()`\nreferences in real (non-custom-property) declarations, it transitively keeps only the custom\nproperties actually reachable, and drops the matching unused `@property` registrations."
msgstr "pantoken sin `@pantoken/css` eksporterer hele `--instui-*` tokensettet (≈1 800 ikon-data-URIer\ninkludert). En renderer som bygger på det laget, men bare styler en del av systemet, ville\nellers inkludere hele settet — så enhver slik renderer trenger dette. Startende fra `var()`\nreferansene i ekte (ikke-egendefinert-eiendom) deklarasjoner, beholdes transitivt bare de egendefinerte\negenskapene som faktisk er nåbare, og de tilsvarende ubrukte `@property`-registreringene fjernes."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It's a standalone PostCSS plugin (run it in your own PostCSS pipeline). The factory returns a\nplain plugin object, so importing this module pulls in no runtime dependency — `postcss` is only\na type."
msgstr "Det er en frittstående PostCSS-plugin (kjør den i din egen PostCSS-pipeline). Fabrikken returnerer et\nvanlig plugin-objekt, så import av denne modulen trekker ikke inn noen runtime-avhengighet — `postcss` er kun\nen type."

#: plugins/postcss/prune-custom-props/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"
msgstr "Omdøper og re-eksporterer [pruneCustomProps](variables/pruneCustomProps.md)"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# theme-custom-media"
msgstr "# theme-custom-media"

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n(`@media (theme: <name>)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then emit concrete CSS for a\nchosen target theme."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-theme-custom-media` — author with theme custom-idents\n(`@media (theme: &lt;name&gt;)`) and/or `@media (--theme-*)` aliases, then emit concrete CSS for a\nchosen target theme."

#: plugins/postcss/theme-custom-media/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The plugin expands built-in `--theme-*` and `--breakpoint-*` aliases, prunes non-target theme\nbranches, strips matching `theme:*` clauses from kept queries, unwraps always-true theme-only media\nwrappers, and removes `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*` declarations from emitted CSS."
msgstr "Pluginet utvider de innebygde `--theme-*` og `--breakpoint-*` aliasene, beskjærer ikke-målrettede temagrener\nfjerner matchende `theme:*`-klausuler fra beholdte spørringer, pakker ut alltid-sanne kun-tema medieinnpakninger\nog fjerner `@custom-media --theme-*`/`--breakpoint-*`-deklarasjoner fra generert CSS."

