#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/foundation` — theme Foundation for Sites with Instructure tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/foundation` — tema for Foundation for Sites med Instructure-tokens."

#: renderers/foundation/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Foundation is Sass-first, so this package ships two layers. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) emits a\n`_settings`-style Sass partial that points Foundation's setting variables at `var(--instui-*)`, so\na Sass build compiles the Instructure look while keeping runtime theming through the same custom\nproperties. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) emits a thin CSS overlay that themes the common compiled\nclasses (`.button`, `.callout`, links) the same way — useful when you consume stock Foundation CSS\nand just want to layer Instructure colors on top without recompiling."
msgstr "Foundation er Sass-først, så denne pakken leveres i to lag. [toFoundationSettings](functions/toFoundationSettings.md) genererer en\n`_settings`-stil Sass-partial som peker Foundations innstillingsvariabler mot `var(--instui-*)`, slik at\nen Sass-build kompilerer Instructure-utseendet samtidig som runtime-tematisering beholdes gjennom de samme egendefinerte\negenskapene. [toFoundationCss](functions/toFoundationCss.md) genererer et tynt CSS-overlegg som tematiserer de vanlige kompilerte\nklassene (`.button`, `.callout`, links) på samme måte — nyttig når du bruker standard Foundation CSS\nog bare vil legge Instructure-farger oppå uten å kompilere på nytt."

