#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# pendo"
msgstr "# pendo"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — et Instructure-stilisert globalt stilark for Pendo-veiledninger."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
msgstr "Pendo injiserer guide-HTML i en vertsside; dette renderer den guide-DOM-en (`._pendo-*`) for å matche\nInstructure UI, ved å bruke pantokens `--instui-*` token-lag for justering. Den inkluderer responsiv\nfiolett og sjø-farget bannerstil for veiledninger sammen med varsler, popovers, undersøkelser og kontroller. Komponent-CSS-en\ner portert fra `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken leverer tokenene og sammenstillingen. En enkelt tema-klasse som inneholder `instui`\naktiverer det scoped stilarket; kompakte suffikser på den klassen velger bannerfarger og glyfer."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) komponerer stilarket; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) er det ferdiglagde `rebrand`-bygget\n(scoped, `!important`). En statisk fil publiseres på `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"
msgstr "Omdøper og re-eksporterer [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"

