msgstr "Legg til `!important` i komponentdeklarasjoner slik at de overstyrer Pendo-stiler (standard `true`)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tree-shake unused `--instui-*` tokens (default `true`; off ships the full token set)."
msgstr "Tree-shake ubrukte `--instui-*`-tokens (standard `true`; av sender hele tokensettet)."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Convert `@property` at-rules to plain custom-property declarations via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (default `false`). `true` uses plugin defaults with\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` so the declarations land inside the `@scope` block.\nPass a [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) object to override individual defaults."
msgstr "Konverter `@property` at-regler til vanlige custom-property-deklarasjoner via\n[flattenProperty](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/flattenProperty.md) (standard `false`). `true` bruker plugin-standarder med\n`injectSelector: \":scope\"` slik at deklarasjonene havner inne i `@scope`-blokken.\nSend et [FlattenPropertyOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/FlattenPropertyOptions.md) objekt for å overstyre individuelle standarder."

#: renderers/pendo/src/interfaces/BuildPendoCssOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mangle `--instui-*` names to minimal base-26 identifiers via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(default `false`). Safe here because the full token + component stylesheet is a\nself-contained bundle. Pass a [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) object to override defaults."
msgstr "Forkort `--instui-*`-navn til minimale base-26-identifikatorer via [mangleCustomProps](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/variables/mangleCustomProps.md)\n(standard `false`). Trygt her fordi hele token- og komponentstilarket er en\nselvstendig pakke. Send et [MangleCustomPropsOptions](../../../../plugins/postcss/props-minify/src/interfaces/MangleCustomPropsOptions.md) objekt for å overstyre standardene."

