#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: buildRegisterContext()"
msgstr "# Funksjon: buildRegisterContext()"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the shared [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) a `register()`-style call threads to every element's\n`define`. The icon resolver is injectable: `register()` always passes the real,\n`@pantoken/icons`-backed [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) (unchanged default behavior for every existing caller),\nwhile the per-element CDN build passes [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) for elements that never call it —\n`@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` is a multi-MB dependency, and since Rollup can't code-split\n`iife`/`umd` output, anything statically reachable from a bundle's entry ends up in the whole\nbundle, regardless of whether that specific element's code path ever invokes it. This module has no\ntop-level side effects for exactly that reason — importing it (unlike importing `../index.ts`, which\nauto-registers everything on import) never reaches [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) unless the caller passes it in."
msgstr "Bygg den delte [RegisterContext](../interfaces/RegisterContext.md) en `register()`-stil kalletråd til hvert elements\n`define`. Ikonoppløseren er injiserbar: `register()` sender alltid den ekte,\n`@pantoken/icons`-støttede [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) (ubeändert standardadferd for alle eksisterende kallere),\nmens per-element CDN-bygget sender [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) for elementer som aldri kaller den —\n`@pantoken/icons`/`@pantoken/tokens` er en fler-MB avhengighet, og siden Rollup ikke kan kode-splitte\n`iife`/`umd`-output, ender alt som er statisk tilgjengelig fra en bundles entry opp i hele\nbundlet, uavhengig av om den spesifikke elementets kodebane noen gang kaller den. Dette modulet har ingen\ntop-nivå sideeffekter av akkurat den grunn — å importere det (i motsetning til å importere `../index.ts`, som\nauto-registrerer alt ved import) når aldri [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) med mindre kalleren sender det inn."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Same shape as `register()`'s options, minus `only`."
msgstr "Samme form som `register()`'s options, minus `only`."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The registry to define into."
msgstr "Registeret å definere i."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### resolveIconSvg"
msgstr "### resolveIconSvg"

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/buildRegisterContext.md
