msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The resolver wired into `ctx.iconSvg` — pass [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) for real icons\n  or [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) when the caller's element set provably never renders one (see\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` in `./elements-meta.ts`)."
msgstr "Oppløseren koblet inn i `ctx.iconSvg` — send [iconSvg](iconSvg.md) for ekte ikoner\n  eller [noopIconSvg](noopIconSvg.md) når kallerenes elementsett beviselig aldri rendrer en (se\n  `ICON_ELEMENTS` i `./elements-meta.ts`)."

