msgid "An [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)-shaped resolver that never resolves anything — for elements that don't need it."
msgstr "En [iconSvg](iconSvg.md)-formet resolver som aldri løser noe — for elementer som ikke trenger det."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Accepts a fully resolved [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *or* a raw BCP47 tag string. When a string is\npassed, [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) derives weekday names via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` and all other strings\nfall back to English; pass a bundle for full translations."
msgstr "Aksepterer en fullstendig oppløst [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) *eller* en rå BCP47-tagg som streng. Når en streng\nblir sendt, utleder [makeStrings](makeStrings.md) ukedagsnavn via `Intl.DateTimeFormat` og alle andre strenger\nfaller tilbake til engelsk; send en bundle for fullstendige oversettelser."

#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/registerLocalized.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md) object, or a BCP47 tag (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."
msgstr "Et [LocaleBundle](../interfaces/LocaleBundle.md)-objekt, eller en BCP47-tagg (`\"hu\"`, `\"ar\"`, …)."

