#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# web-components"
msgstr "# web-components"

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/web-components` — framework-agnostic custom elements for Instructure UI."
msgstr "`@pantoken/web-components` — rammeverksuavhengige egendefinerte elementer for Instructure UI."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[register](functions/register.md) (auto-invoked in the browser) defines the full `<instui-*>` element set into\nany custom-element registry. Each element renders the matching `@pantoken/components` CSS into\nits shadow root; tokens are inherited custom properties that pierce the shadow boundary — load\n`@pantoken/css` to supply them."
msgstr "[register](functions/register.md) (automatisk kalt i nettleseren) definerer hele `<instui-*>`-elementssettet i\nen hvilken som helst registrering for egendefinerte elementer. Hvert element rendrer den tilsvarende `@pantoken/components`-CSS-en i\nsin shadow root; tokens er arvede egendefinerte egenskaper (custom properties) som bryter gjennom shadow-grensen — last\n`@pantoken/css` for å levere dem."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For localized UI strings (calendar nav labels, date-input placeholder, drilldown Back text) pass\n`locale`, `strings`, or `dir` options to [register](functions/register.md). The full Canvas-parity bundle set and\nthe [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) helper are exported from this package as well."
msgstr "For lokaliserte UI-strenger (kalendernavigasjonsetiketter, plassholder i datainput, drilldown «Back»-tekst) send\n`locale`, `strings` eller `dir`-valg til [register](functions/register.md). Hele Canvas-paritets bundle-settet og\nen hjelpefunksjon [registerLocalized](functions/registerLocalized.md) eksporteres også fra denne pakken."

#: renderers/web-components/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The module is Node-safe: element classes are defined inside [register](functions/register.md), a no-op when there\nis no DOM, so importing during SSR or a build never touches `HTMLElement`."
msgstr "Modulen er Node-sikker: elementklassene defineres inne i [register](functions/register.md), en no-op når det ikke finnes en DOM, så import under SSR eller ved bygg berører aldri `HTMLElement`."

